      "writtenOn": "2018-12-07T11:37:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Concerning with meter_config addition, I imagine the the workflow as follows.\n1) Meter mod message is received from the controller and then stored under the corresponding logical_devices\u0027s meters directory, in kv store. \n2) Having the meter_config info stored in kv store, a service flow that is referencing one or more meter_configs is passed unchanged, to the device adapter(e.g. OpenOltAdapter) and the device adapter is going to get the corresponding meter_config components from the kv store in order to calculate the TrafficDescriptorInfo entity\u0027s related parameters.\n\n\nI would like to ask wheterher the meter_config update is a possible scenario or not? If it is, then I need to find the related flow in which the corresponding meter_id is referenced, and then trigger flow update procedure?",
      "parentUuid": "0db1d20b_d4cc78f4",
      "revId": "3d2e57bb6d3415855626594a397ab45214feb119",
